  "item_short_desc": "<p>Explore the outdoors in style with Rothco's Vintage M-65 Field Pants. Crafted from a heavy 9 oz material, these pants boast durability and a classic look. The two adjustable waist tabs with reinforced bartacks, suspender loops, and drawstring bottom ensure a customizable fit. Pleated knees add flexibility and comfort to your outdoor adventures. Elevate your outdoor wardrobe with Rothco's Vintage M-65 Field Pants, blending timeless design with rugged functionality. Complete your look with the complimentary Field Jacket and Field Jacket Liner.</p>",
